<section class="qadr-knowledge three-tool-knowledge" id="qadr-guide" aria-labelledby="qadr-guide-heading">
 <h2 id="qadr-guide-heading">Laylatul Qadr: the last ten nights, odd nights, dua and complete guide</h2>
 <p><strong>Short answer:</strong> Seek Laylatul Qadr throughout Ramadan's <strong>last ten nights</strong>, paying special attention to odd-numbered nights. The commonly listed 21st, 23rd, 25th, 27th and 29th nights are <strong>planning dates, not predictions</strong> that any single evening is definitely Laylatul Qadr.</p>
